<b>Subject:</b>&nbsp;For the Record =97 Supervisory Betrayal</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr;">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>Logan,</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
This letter names the harm you caused through betrayal of supervisory trust=
 and weaponization of vulnerability I shared with you in confidence.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You held authority over me as Volunteer Services Lead. That role requires i=
ntegrity, discretion, and the protection of those under your supervision. Y=
ou failed at every level.</div>
<hr style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>THE DISCLOSURES</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
During our walk at Honeyman, I shared why I had moved into an RV and reloca=
ted to the coast=97my analysis of systemic instability, my strategic thinki=
ng about resilience, and my concerns as a queer person about authoritarian =
targeting through institutional actors.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Before that conversation, I set a clear boundary: I told you explicitly thi=
s was not romantic for me.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You took what I shared in confidence and disclosed it to management. That i=
nformation was then weaponized by Allison Watson to pathologize my characte=
r during dismissal proceedings=97reframing reasoned analysis as &quot;apoca=
lyptic thinking&quot; and using my fears about
 identity-based targeting as evidence of instability.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
By now you have seen the videos. You know how they used what I told you. Yo=
u know the harm that followed.</div>
<hr style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>THE DISTORTION</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Allison Watson claimed I told you &quot;I was worried you would kill me.&qu=
ot; That is a deliberate distortion.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
What I actually said was that in authoritarian contexts, people like you=97=
institutional actors with authority=97would be the mechanism through which =
targeting of queer people would occur.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You visibly recoiled when I said this.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
At the time, I interpreted your reaction as discomfort with the subject mat=
ter. Later, I understood: you were already doing exactly what I had describ=
ed=97using your institutional position to target my identity.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
And you did this after I explicitly told you the conversation was not roman=
tic. You weaponized a boundary I set with you in good faith.</div>
<hr style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>THE PATTERN</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You elicited trust through reciprocal vulnerability. You spent 90 minutes t=
alking about yourself=97your background, your concerns, your perspectives. =
The following day, I reciprocated. That is how trust-building works.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
But after I opened up, you distanced yourself. Then you disclosed what I sh=
ared to people who were already working to remove me.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
That is not supervision. That is betrayal.</div>
<hr style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>THE ENABLING</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Your disclosures gave Ryan Warren, Kati Baker, and Allison Watson the ammun=
ition they needed to justify what they had already decided to do.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Ryan used it to mock me at the day-use meeting=97suggesting I &quot;thought=
 I had a future with you&quot;=97weaponizing my sexuality and distorting or=
dinary human connection into something inappropriate.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
I am certain that insinuation entered the narrative with your consent.</div=
>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Kati and Allison used your disclosures to construct a psychological profile=
 justifying my permanent dismissal=97reframing vulnerability as instability=
, analysis as extremism, and identity-based fears as concerning behavior.</=
div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You enabled that. Actively. With full knowledge of what they were doing.</d=
iv>
<hr style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>WHAT YOU SHOULD UNDERSTAND</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
I treated you with integrity you never had.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Despite your pattern of intimacy followed by distance, I continued to see t=
he best in you. I made space for the tension between your depth and the ins=
titution you serve. I chose to believe you were capable of better.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
I was wrong.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
You had every opportunity to protect what I shared with you. Instead, you d=
elivered it to people who used it to harm me.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
That choice=97to betray supervisory trust and weaponize queer vulnerability=
 after I explicitly set a boundary with you=97is now part of the permanent =
record.</div>
<hr style=3D"direction: ltr;">
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
